  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You walk a careful path around your enemies, knowing their every move before they make it.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Kirin Path<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When making a Knowledge check to identify a creature, you can take 20 on the check a number of times per day equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1). In addition, when you use an attack of opportunity to move after a creature you have studied ends its turn in your threatened area, you can end your move in a square that is not threatened by the creature. Alternatively, you can remain within the creature’s threatened area but move an additional 5 feet per 2 mythic tiers (minimum 5 feet).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc204\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
